# All optional — every value below has a sensible default.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and uncomment any line you want to override.

# Directory containing your Claude Code transcripts (*.jsonl).
# Default: ~/.claude/projects
# CLAUDE_PROJECTS_DIR=/path/to/.claude/projects

# --- Chat panel (optional) ---
# The Overview chat panel talks to a local LM Studio OpenAI-compatible server.
# If LM Studio isn't running, only the chat panel is affected — the rest of the
# dashboard works normally.

# LM Studio base URL.
# Default: http://localhost:1234/v1
# LM_STUDIO_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1

# Model id to chat with — must match a model loaded in LM Studio.
# Default: google/gemma-4-e4b
# LM_STUDIO_MODEL=google/gemma-4-e4b
